  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'BUILD A REAL HOME


    Drive gently to marked branch, stick, leaf, moss
    or decoration piles. Stop and tap ACTION to grasp the nearest loose material.
    The physical gripper can break under hard impacts. Tap again to enter PLACEMENT,
    braking the truck. Move left/right and forward/back to position the hand. HOLD
    ACTION while placing to change height (forward/back) and rotation (left/right).
    A short tap releases the material.


    Build the crossing timbers from the
    ground up, then leaves and protective moss. Pieces must actually rest on rooted
    supports before they interlock. Broken or unsupported connections stop nest stability.
    Decorations reward creativity.


    A stable complete nest receives a real egg.
    Protect it on the lining until it hatches into wiggling baby trucks. Cooperative
    players share one untimed nest, ending with a family or FINISH WORKSHOP in Pause.
    The six-minute quality challenge gives each player a nest. AI physically gathers,
    carries and places the same materials.


    Pause to request a workshop save
    through the shared save adapter. Release held materials before saving. Restart
    resets the workshop; no pickups count as construction.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: be1034cebd9fa3643a48d11ef76e4708, type: 2}
